    "title": "Officials reveal cause of roof leak at Bojangles Coliseum - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WSOCTV.com News Staff ,\n11 hours ago The team used trash cans on Sunday to collect rainwater. Sunday’s leak at Bojangles Coliseum was caused by heavy rain that day and a recent ice and snowstorm, the Charlotte Regional Visitors Authority said.\nREAD MORE: Bojangles Coliseum roof leak comes as Charlotte leaders prepare to discuss renovations\nThe roofing contractor identified the section of roof where the water incursion happened and fixed it, CRVA officials said.\nThe roof was already in the process of being sealed as part of planned work.\nVIDEO: Bojangles Coliseum roof leak comes as Charlotte leaders prepare to discuss renovations",
    "summary": "By WSOCTV.com News Staff , 11 hours ago The team used trash cans on Sunday to collect rainwater. Sunday’s leak at Bojangles Coliseum was caused by heavy rain that day and a recent ice and snowstorm, the Charlotte Regional Visitors Authority said. READ MORE: Bojangles Coliseum roof leak comes as Charlotte leaders prepare to discuss renovations The roofing contractor identified the section of roof where the water incursion happened and fixed it, CRVA officials said. The roof was already in the process of being sealed as part of planned work.",
